{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PALEVO \u2014 an atmospheric indie simulator about a stash runner. You are a courier without a name: you hide packages, take risky routes through a nighttime city, and try to stay unnoticed. Manage your time, choose types of drops, photograph locations for reports, and keep records \u2014 every mistake can cost you your freedom. And you will pay that price. Sooner or later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMPORTANT:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fictional simulation and does not promote illegal activity.<br>All actions depicted in the game are extremely dangerous and in real life can lead to long prison terms, up to LIFE IMPRISONMENT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's purpose is to show how easily you can lose your freedom and what risks are associated with criminal activity. There are no winners here: the game is a simulation of consequences, not a how-to guide.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126360?t=1761466361","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126360/f00df44670a27c78878331dd1b518ed69b8d1f08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761466361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126360/43649924d59119369c6f5fd8661e410f462ab07d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761466361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126360/43649924d59119369c6f5fd8661e410f462ab07d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761466361","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PALEVO \u2014 an atmospheric indie simulator about a stash runner. You are a courier without a name: you hide packages, take risky routes through a nighttime city, and try to stay unnoticed. Manage your time, choose types of drops, photograph locations for reports, and keep records \u2014 every mistake can cost you your freedom. And you will pay that price. Sooner or later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMPORTANT:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fictional simulation and does not promote illegal activity.<br>All actions depicted in the game are extremely dangerous and in real life can lead to long prison terms, up to LIFE IMPRISONMENT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's purpose is to show how easily you can lose your freedom and what risks are associated with criminal activity. There are no winners here: the game is a simulation of consequences, not a how-to guide.</p>","developers":["Grey District","\u0420\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0438\u044f"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126360/82d26b569d7d9161da29e6ab5729a8a4a2a765af/header.jpg?t=1761466361","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4126360/313898726/8b2280fba2ba31e4be4c309bbbdc06f2bd0d49a8/1761046883/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761466359","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4126360/313898726/8b2280fba2ba31e4be4c309bbbdc06f2bd0d49a8/1761046883/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761466359","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4126360/313898726/8b2280fba2ba31e4be4c309bbbdc06f2bd0d49a8/1761046883/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761466359","id":257220472,"name":"Palevo \u2014 Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com